3) Build process

code we write is not exceuted in browser instead it get transformed before it is exceuted in browser
Reason why it get transformed
a)unprocessed react code would not execute in browser as jsx is not default javascript feature.we will see error.
b) it will be not be optimized for production.with help vite react create app come up with already handled


4) Import and Export 

Different way of import and Export
a) import new(name of function) from src
b) import {new}(name of function) from src
c) import default(name of function) from src only default work in single file
d) import * as (name of function) from src
e) import * as(abc(can define name as per our requiremnt for a function)abc) (name of function) from src.

